---

<DemoLayout title="Phase 4: Interop Sandbox">
	<main style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-start; min-height: 100vh; padding-top: 4rem;">
		<h1 style="color: var(--ph-orange); font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">PROJECT PRISM DEMO</h1>
		<p style="font-family: monospace; opacity: 0.8; letter-spacing: 0.1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">PHASE 4: DYNAMIC REGISTRY & GHOST LINK VERIFICATION</p>
		
        <DemoSandbox client:only="react" />

        <div style="margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.7; max-width: 600px; text-align: center;">
            <p>This sandbox demonstrates the <strong>Hybrid Handle</strong> architecture (Option C). The metadata above is being retrieved from a dynamic, resident registry inside the Pharos Rust/WASM core.</p>
        </div>
	</main>
</DemoLayout>
